                        "text": "Access to five Florida locations for parts and service"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Maintenance plans tailored to your business and schedule"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Support from a family-owned dealership that values honesty and dependability"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "A team that treats your trucks and your success like our own"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-partner-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At the end of the day, your drivers deserve safe, reliable trucks. And you deserve a service partner who makes that easy. Visit a Sun State International location today to experience the difference of working with a team that truly cares about your fleet.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
